# Notebooks are edited on both the Mac and the 5090 box. A plain text merge
# mangles them: every re-run bumps execution counts and rewrites output blobs,
# so git reports a conflict on cells that didn't meaningfully change.
#
# nbdime merges them cell-wise instead. This file makes the *mapping* travel
# with the repo; the driver itself is machine-local, so each machine also needs
# a one-time `nbdime config-git --enable` (scripts/setup-local.sh does it).
# Without that setup git just falls back to the normal merge — no error.
*.ipynb  merge=jupyternotebook  diff=jupyternotebook

# Keep notebooks out of GitHub's language stats — this is a notes repo.
*.ipynb  linguist-documentation
